   Oh   Cl       1    6.13e-03    1.79e-05
    O   Cl       1    6.13e-03    1.79e-05
   Cl   Cl       1    1.22e-02    8.82e-05
; pairwise LJ for silica and water CLAYFF (2 combination rule)
  Si  OWT      1    1.11e-05    1.26e-08
  Ob  OWT      1    2.85e-03    2.84e-06
  Oh  OWT      1    2.85e-03    2.84e-06
   O  OWT      1    2.85e-03    2.84e-06
